---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refund & Cancellation Policy | Chandler David Smith" description="Refund and cancellation policies for courses, events, community membership, and consulting services from Chandler David Smith.">

  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-navy-900 min-h-screen">
    <div class="section-container max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-12">Last updated: March 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-300">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Digital Products (Course)</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            We offer a <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold">30-day money-back guarantee</span> on our online course. If you are not satisfied with the course for any reason, you can request a full refund within 30 days of your purchase date.
          </p>
          <p>
            To request a refund, contact us at support@chandlerdavidsmith.com with your order number and the reason for your request. Refunds are processed within 5-10 business days and will be returned to the original payment method.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Events & Retreats</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">Event ticket refunds are based on the following schedule:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span>
                <span class="text-white font-medium">30+ days before the event:</span> Full refund available.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-2 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span>
                <span class="text-white font-medium">14-30 days before the event:</span> 50% refund, or you may transfer your ticket to another attendee at no charge.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 mt-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span>
                <span class="text-white font-medium">Less than 14 days before the event:</span> No refund available. Tickets are transferable to another attendee.
              </span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            In the unlikely event that we cancel an event, all ticket holders will receive a full refund.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Community Membership</h2>
          <p>
            Community memberships (Creative Cashflow Club) can be <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold">cancelled at any time</span> from your account settings. Your access will continue until the end of your current billing period. No partial refunds are issued for the remaining days in a billing cycle. There are no cancellation fees.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Consulting Sessions</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Consulting calls can be rescheduled or cancelled with at least <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold">24 hours notice</span> before the scheduled call time for a full refund or credit toward a future session.
          </p>
          <p>
            Cancellations made with less than 24 hours notice, or no-shows, are non-refundable. Unused consulting calls in multi-session packages are valid for 6 months from the date of purchase.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            For all refund and cancellation requests, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">
            Email: support@chandlerdavidsmith.com
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
